        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>明朝的统治 思维导图设计意图</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:#f2f0ea;\n    font-family:\"Kaiti SC\",\"KaiTi\",\"STKaiti\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",serif;\n    color:#1b2a4a;\n  }\n  .page{\n    width:540px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    background:#f6f4ee;\n    padding:8px 10px 30px 10px;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    position:relative;\n  }\n  .intro{\n    font-size:13px;\n    line-height:1.7;\n    text-indent:1.6em;\n    padding:6px 4px 2px 4px;\n    border-bottom:1px solid #9aa6b8;\n  }\n  .zone-label{\n    font-size:12px;\n    padding:3px 2px;\n    border-bottom:1px solid #9aa6b8;\n  }\n  .map{\n    position:relative;\n    font-size:12.5px;\n    line-height:1.7;\n    padding:6px 0 6px 0;\n    min-height:390px;\n  }\n  .row{display:flex;align-items:center;}\n  .brace{\n    font-size:22px;\n    line-height:1;\n    padding:0 3px;\n    color:#1b2a4a;\n  }\n  .tallbrace{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    font-size:60px;\n    font-weight:300;\n    padding:0 4px;\n    color:#1b2a4a;\n  }\n  .root{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    width:60px;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:14px;\n  }\n  .lvl1{\n    width:52px;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:13px;\n  }\n  .lvl2{\n    width:48px;\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n  .group{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    margin:4px 0;\n  }\n  .items div{white-space:nowrap;}\n  .sub{padding-left:2.2em;}\n  .placeholder{\n    width:110px;\n    height:52px;\n    border:1px dashed #b06a86;\n    color:#b06a86;\n    font-size:10px;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n    position:absolute;\n    right:14px;\n    top:296px;\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  }\n  .bottom{\n    border-top:1px solid #9aa6b8;\n    padding-top:4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"intro\">\n    学完了本课，请你以自己擅长的形式，为本课所学知识画一幅示意图，揭示[illegible]识间的联系。可以是思维导图，也可以是结构图、漫画等。请写出你的设计意[?]，让老师看得懂。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"zone-label\">[?]图区：</div>\n\n  <div class=\"map\">\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"root\">明朝<br>的统治</div>\n      <div class=\"tallbrace\">{</div>\n\n      <div>\n        <!-- 建立 -->\n        <div class=\"group\">\n          <div class=\"lvl1\">建立</div>\n          <div class=\"brace\" style=\"font-size:44px;\">{</div>\n          <div class=\"items\">\n            <div>时间：1368年</div>\n            <div>建立者：朱元璋</div>\n            <div>都城：应天府（南京）</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 强化皇权 -->\n        <div class=\"group\">\n          <div class=\"lvl1\">强化<br>皇权</div>\n          <div class=\"brace\" style=\"font-size:90px;font-weight:300;\">{</div>\n          <div class=\"items\">\n            <div class=\"group\" style=\"margin:2px 0;\">\n              <div class=\"lvl2\">改革</div>\n              <div class=\"brace\" style=\"font-size:50px;\">{</div>\n              <div>\n                <div>地方：设立“三司”，分散行省的权力</div>\n                <div class=\"sub\">分封诸子为王，驻守各地，监控地方</div>\n                <div>中央：废除丞相制度和中书省，设</div>\n                <div class=\"sub\">立五军都督府</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div>设锦衣卫：为监视官民，后设立了东厂，这两</div>\n            <div>个机构合称为“厂卫”，由皇帝直接指挥</div>\n            <div>立“祖制”：规定子子孙孙不得改变他的做法</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 科举考试 -->\n        <div class=\"group\">\n          <div class=\"lvl1\">科举<br>考试</div>\n          <div class=\"brace\" style=\"font-size:70px;\">{</div>\n          <div class=\"items\">\n            <div>范围：“四书”“五经”</div>\n            <div>标准：朱熹的《四书集注》</div>\n            <div>格式：八股文</div>\n            <div>影响：禁锢思想，成为皇帝旨意的顺从者</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[图片：手绘郁金香与“LEI蕾 From 小红书”水印，右侧中部]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom\">\n    <div class=\"zone-label\" style=\"border-bottom:none;\">设计意图说明：</div>\n    <div class=\"map\" style=\"min-height:auto;\">\n      <div class=\"group\">\n        <div class=\"lvl1\">经济</div>\n        <div class=\"brace\" style=\"font-size:70px;\">{</div>\n        <div class=\"items\">\n          <div>农业：引进玉米，甘薯，马铃薯，花生，向日葵等</div>\n          <div>手工业：棉纺织业，丝织业（苏州），制瓷业（景德镇[?]</div>\n          <div class=\"group\" style=\"margin:2px 0;\">\n            <div class=\"lvl2\">商业</div>\n            <div class=\"brace\" style=\"font-size:40px;\">{</div>\n            <div>\n              <div>城市：北京，南京等</div>\n              <div>商帮：晋商，徽商</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
